## Record Producers
There are 2 record producers used to create the registration forms.

## Widgets
There are 3 widget instances provided in the Training Portal which have been created using Widget Instance with Link. 

## Scripts
Minimal scripting used which includes -
1. Client Script for populating available slots for training on catalog form load.
2. Client Script to display popup on successful form submission.
3. Portal redirect script(redirect to Homepage) in record producers.
4. Calculating available slots based on Registration table in the dictionary entry-

(function calculatedFieldValue(current) {
var inc = new GlideRecord('x_957439_trainin_0_registrations');
inc.addEncodedQuery('training_start_date=' +current.sys_id'^training_status=Confirmed');
inc.query();
return current.total_slots = inc.getRowCount();
}) (current);

## Catalog UI Policy
The 'Certifications' field will be hidden initially in the form.
UI Policy and action to make the field visible if the field ‘Certificate’ choice is Yes.
  
## Notifications
4 email notifications have been created which will get triggered once the workflow actions are triggered –
1. Training Request Opened - Notification triggered to inform user that a request number has been generated on form submission.
2. Training Request Opened - Notification triggered to inform trainer that a request number has been generated on form submission.
3. Approval for training request- Notification triggered to inform the manager of the employee to approve the pending request submitted.
4. Approval for trainer request – Notification triggered to inform the manager of the employee to approve the pending request submitted.




 
